{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":3073029,"ns":0,"title":"Agitator (device)","extract":"An agitator is a device or mechanism to put something into motion by shaking or stirring. There are several types of agitation machines, including washing machine agitators (which rotate back and forth) and magnetic agitators (which contain a magnetic bar rotating in a magnetic field).","description":"Device or mechanism which shakes or stirs something","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}